json5p/structured
description: Composite value that nests other json5p values
- >
  The structured shapes of json5p are those of JSON5 - the keyed **object** and the positional
  **list** - with their pairs and elements now nesting json5p values, so a pointer or an
  bookmarked value can stand inside either. See the subchapters below for the two shapes:
- *: 00-json5p_object
- *: 01-json5p_list
